  grade: 'Class 5',
  emoji: '🥭',
  chapterText:
      'Every year, Mrs. Deshmukh\'s ancient mango orchard produced the sweetest fruit in the entire district, '
      'and every year, she generously distributed baskets of mangoes to her neighbours once the harvest was '
